1
00:00:00,014 --> 00:00:02,804
(Leonard:)Still, I think it's time for me
to get rid of this stuff...

2
00:00:02,975 --> 00:00:05,815
...and, you know, move on with my life.

3
00:00:05,978 --> 00:00:08,648
- Really?
- Yeah.

4
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:10,144
(Penny:)Oh. Wow.

5
00:00:10,316 --> 00:00:12,066
(Leonard:)Good for you.

6
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:14,150
(Penny:)Thanks.

7
00:00:15,821 --> 00:00:18,031
Hey, do you wanna,
I don't know, later...?

8
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:19,699
(Good looking man coming up stairs:)Excuse me.

9
00:00:20,117 --> 00:00:21,367
(Good looking man coming up stairs:)- Hey, Penny.
- Hi, Mike.

10
00:00:21,535 --> 00:00:23,415
- You ready to go?
- I just have to change.

11
00:00:23,579 --> 00:00:26,329
- I'll give you a hand.
- Oh, stop it.

12
00:00:26,499 --> 00:00:28,169
(Penny:)Bye, guys.

13
00:00:28,334 --> 00:00:29,334
[DOOR CLOSES]

14
00:00:32,713 --> 00:00:59,023
(Leonard(after a long pause):)My turn on the time machine.

